's giving the gal peace sign or maybe throwing a kiss? Something really cute would be great.\n\nI would like to use this for net prints!\nSo for the background, I'd like something where she's in the middle of a busy city with bright lights (something like Akihabara or Shibuya)\n\nThank you very much!\n\nPlease refer to the image below for Jan-chan's standing picture.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1OQ6LsvXt4VHicpsyMvGKqzR0it3UxKmx/view?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@PPYM_chan_X/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2901511, "client_id": 3551736, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c319a2bc/uploads/origins/da4df3e8-aa65-462f-957b-5758719c780c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b3bd87325180c288f4eb7d6d8fa80c8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c319a2bc/uploads/origins/da4df3e8-aa65-462f-957b-5758719c780c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b3bd87325180c288f4eb7d6d8fa80c8, https://si.imgix.net/c319a2bc/uploads/origins/da4df3e8-aa65-462f-957b-5758719c780c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=998e4d188e2e50416a9f4bbd61c88cfd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c319a2bc/uploads/origins/da4df3e8-aa65-462f-957b-5758719c780c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=023d5384a8a31cffb2cf6a4e7681af70 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c319a2bc/uploads/origins/da4df3e8-aa65-462f-957b-5758719c780c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d02791eb19e695d3b3f23c85b923220c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c319a2bc/uploads/origins/da4df3e8-aa65-462f-957b-5758719c780c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&